    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nStanding on approx. .85 of one hectare/2.1 acres, we are delighted to offer this super bungalow for sale, located close to the beautiful village of Camross.Built in 2004 the house floor area extends to approx. 163 sq. mts/1,754 sq. ft. Accommodation includes an entrance hallway, a home office, a sitting room, a kitchen/dining room, three/four bedrooms, one with an ensuite bathroom, a family bathroom, and a utility room. The rooms are large and there is plenty of scope to extend the bungalow should one need to. The rooms are bright with large windows, and there is a great sense of space inside and outside the house. Underfloor oil fired central heating is installed, Upvc double glazed windows, a private well and the house has a C1 BER rating. A new sewerage treatment system has also been installed. Outside there is a large garden and paddock and it is possible to drive all around the house. With this space there is potential to add a kitchen garden or erect a garage in time.Located in a such a scenic region, at the foothills of the Slieve Bloom mountains, surrounded by beautiful hilly countryside, with a beautiful local community. There is a local National School, local Pub, Church and a thriving GAA Club. The house is positioned just 15 kms from the nearest junction on the M7, 10 kms from Mountrath, approx. 22 kms from Portlaoise. Please call Julie Fogarty 0505 21192"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nKitchen come dining room - \n\n\nSitting room - \n\n\nUtility Room. - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - \n\n\nBedroom 2 - \n\n\nBedroom 3 - \n\n\nBedroom 4 - \n\n\nBathroom - \n\n\nEn-Suite - \n\n\nHome office - \n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Underfloor heating (Oil fired) </li><li>Wood burning stove in sitting room.</li><li>Bright and cheerful rooms.</li><li>Large site 2.1 acres with plenty of room for extensions and garages/sheds subject to planning permission. </li><li>Private well with water sotener & filter. </li><li>Stira attic stairs. </li><li>Jacuzzi bath. </li><li>Local National school & buses to Mountrath Secondary School. </li><li>Ballybrophy Railway Station and the M7 are very convenient to the house.</ul>"
      },
